{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is similar to &quot;Vampire Survivor&quot; and &quot;Like Flesh Cutting&quot;, but it doesn't have a card-drawing mechanism. The game consists of 4 maps, and all screenshots are real-game images. The core gameplay is as follows: Kill monsters to obtain experience points, and after upgrading, you can allocate skill points; Upgrade the &quot;gold, wood, water, fire, earth&quot; five elements to level 3 to unlock different powerful skills; Gold gains lightning, wood gains a health recovery area, water gains water wave balls, fire gains a fire whirlwind, and earth gains a black hole. The game has 4 maps, 1 basin, 2 islands, 3 snowy areas, and 4 hells (large map), among which 1 basin and 4 hells have a weather system that includes rain and lightning. The 4 maps correspond to different difficulties, with various monsters such as human-like monsters, zombie dogs, venomous spiders, eight-legged sea serpents, and you can win this level by surviving to 20 waves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/6a60bee5de710622a92d609565d87bf5.avif?t=1763790385\" width=920 height=430 /></span>\u00a0Jin gains Lightning, Mu gains Health Regeneration Field, Shui gains Water Wave Ball, Huo gains Fire Whirl, Tu gains Black Hole<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/de2633022712c0c11fc26d1a9c5054a5.avif?t=1763790385\" width=1560 height=838 /></span>\u00a0The game has 4 maps, 1 basin, 2 islands, 3 snowy areas, and 4 hell (the large map). Among them, the 1st basin and the 4th hell also have a weather system that includes rain and lightning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066140/extras/f940eeeb6cf03671bbcc674e064f5e4b.avif?t=1763790385\" width=1091 height=722 